                  CENTRALIZED EXCHANGE
                </h1>
                <p class="portfolio-slide-left-categories-2-white mt-4">
                  We build a Centralized exchange that acts as a third party to buy and sell cryptocurrencies. They
                  serve as trusted intermediaries in transactions and will often act as a custodian, for the
                  preservation and protection of their funds. </p>
